  "guarantee": "U4.7a claims containment of the merge child and pre-effect refusal or bounded admission for the enumerated roots only. With D5 active and fixed default gate roots, no designed effect of review.py or committee.py writes coordinator state, a run root, the tracker or the forge. This assumes, externally and throughout admitted execution, a usable standard temporary directory so the stdlib default search never reaches its cwd fallback; this continuing host precondition is not verified or enforced. D5-active merge launch refuses at entry pending U4.9/U8 executable binding and integrity review. The drift guard covers canonical main comparisons only; compound guards and entry-point completeness remain U4.9 acceptance items.",
